repository-code: 'https://github.com/jontymarshall/artefact'
abstract: >-
  The artefact package is a 1D radiative transfer code
  written in Python to model the optically thin emission of
  axisymmetric debris discs using parametric dust grain size
  distribution and disc architecture. The package comes with
  tools to help model not only the spectral energy
  distribution but also the related scattered light and
  thermal emission from the disc.
